window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A Slayer’s Oath. A Forbidden Passion.</p> <p>After Roxy’s victory in the Pit, she has an even bigger target on her back. She needs to leave Seattle and never return. But her sister lands on her doorstep and the Slayers strong-arm her to return to the roster, forcing her to stay in Seattle and risk O’Malley’s wrath.</p> <p>But staying in Seattle means more time with a certain vampire prince. Tyee’s interest in Roxy has been noted by the Queen and now his courtship of Roxy escalates. Can their feelings grow under the hothouse environment of the Night Court or will they be crushed under the pressure?</p> <p>Either way, Roxy must use her alliances to fight O’Malley’s forces. With everything on the line, Roxy will face O’Malley in a final showdown for her friends and her love.</p> <p>Can Roxy protect her loved ones and the city, or will her choices tear everything apart? Find out in this thrilling urban fantasy adventure.</p>"; 
